<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Who I Am</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Bratz</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Rock Angelz</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7CiWBdnyZYjj2jGxVWKJdT</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.780" end="00:05.370">Tell you about a city girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.370" end="00:06.870">shes suprising</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.720" end="00:11.820">you never get the better</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.820" end="00:13.710">so totally amazing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.710" end="00:18.510">dont worry about nothing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.510" end="00:23.790">she just gotta be free, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.790" end="00:25.980">so dont you, dont you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.980" end="00:27.510">try to mess with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.510" end="00:31.050">CHORUS</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.050" end="00:32.670">they cant tame us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.670" end="00:34.560">so they blame us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.560" end="00:36.960">for everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.960" end="00:40.350">so I say hey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.350" end="00:43.650">people dont know who I am</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.650" end="00:45.150">all they can say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.220" end="00:48.810">shes a bad girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.810" end="00:52.110">but they just dont understand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.110" end="00:53.880">no they dont know who I am</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.880" end="00:57.870">thats right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.870" end="00:59.370">burst my bubble</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.130" end="01:04.410">just try, why dont you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.410" end="01:06.030">it dont matter anyway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.030" end="01:07.800">im putting up a great show</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.800" end="01:12.690">moving on up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.690" end="01:18.000">and it feels so right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.000" end="01:20.670">speeding in the fast lane</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.670" end="01:22.860">that is my vibe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.860" end="01:25.140">CHORUS</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.140" end="01:26.790">they cant tame us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.790" end="01:28.680">so they blame us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.680" end="01:31.680">for everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.680" end="01:34.410">hey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.410" end="01:37.710">people dont know who I am</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.710" end="01:41.130">all the can say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.130" end="01:42.870">she's a bad girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.870" end="01:46.260">but they just dont understand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.260" end="01:47.760">no they dont know who I am</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.100" end="01:55.100">no no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.070" end="02:08.220">I hear knocking at my door</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.220" end="02:11.220">I turn the stereo up some more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.220" end="02:13.200">but what can you do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.200" end="02:15.570">when they blame it all on you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.570" end="02:18.960">CHORUS</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.960" end="02:21.750">hey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.750" end="02:25.050">people dont know who I am</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.050" end="02:28.470">all they can say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.470" end="02:30.210">she's a bad girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.210" end="02:33.540">but they just dont understand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.540" end="02:35.040">no they dont know who I am</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.500" end="02:38.500">no no</p></div></body></tt>